So take the rest.

260
00:14:37,998 --> 00:14:44,212
Give yourself the space you need before you propel yourself forward.

261
00:14:44,212 --> 00:14:48,258
Recognize any barriers you might still be facing

262
00:14:48,258 --> 00:14:51,887
and give yourself the grace to step around them.

263
00:14:51,887 --> 00:14:54,097
And when you're ready,

264
00:14:54,097 --> 00:14:55,849
move forward.

265
00:14:55,849 --> 00:14:57,851
Shed your cocoon.

266
00:14:57,851 --> 00:15:00,354
Spread your beautiful new wings.

267
00:15:00,354 --> 00:15:03,440
Your metamorphosis is complete.

268
00:15:03,440 --> 00:15:06,276
I am rebelliously optimistic that after today,

269
00:15:06,276 --> 00:15:09,154
you will see setbacks so much more clearly,

270
00:15:09,154 --> 00:15:13,992
and you will emerge from them with a sense of all you can achieve.

271
00:15:13,992 --> 00:15:16,203
Remember that setback I asked you to think of

272
00:15:16,203 --> 00:15:18,372
at the beginning of this talk?

273
00:15:18,372 --> 00:15:20,916
Visualize it again.

274
00:15:20,916 --> 00:15:23,168
Now ask yourself,

275
00:15:23,168 --> 00:15:28,215
how did that setback set the stage for your reinvention?

276
00:15:28,215 --> 00:15:29,508
Thank you.

277
00:15:29,508 --> 00:15:33,508
(Applause)
